---
// Public privacy policy for the Play Store listings. Deliberately indexable
// (noindex={false}) and app-agnostic so one URL serves every game listing.
import MinimalLayout from "../layout/MinimalLayout.astro";

const updated = "October 1, 2026";
const contactEmail = "farooqinfocus@gmail.com";
---

<MinimalLayout title="Privacy Policy — Farooq Zahid" noindex={false}>
  <p class="not-prose mb-8 text-sm">
    <a class="text-blue-600 underline" href="/">← mfarooqzahid.github.io</a>
  </p>

  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: {updated}</em></p>

  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how Farooq Zahid ("we", "us") handles
    information in the mobile games <strong>Cat Stack</strong> and
    <strong>Emoji Mashup</strong> (each, an "App"), published on Google Play.
  </p>

  <h2>Summary</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The Apps are offline games for children. There are no accounts and no
      sign-in.</li>
    <li>We do not collect or store personal information about you or your
      child.</li>
    <li>Game progress and settings are stored only on your device.</li>
    <li>The Apps use Google Mobile Ads to show ads and Google Play Billing for
      the optional "Remove Ads" purchase. These Google services process limited
      data as described below.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We do not ask for or collect personal information such as names, email
    addresses, phone numbers, contacts, photos, or precise location. The Apps
    contain no analytics or crash-reporting SDK.
  </p>
  <p>
    Game progress (levels completed, stars) and preferences (sound, music, crate
    speed) are saved locally on your device using the operating system's
    storage. This information stays on the device, is not transmitted to us, and
    is removed when you uninstall an App.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    The Apps use <strong>Google Mobile Ads (AdMob)</strong> to show interstitial
    ads between levels. Google and its advertising partners may automatically
    collect and process certain information in connection with serving and
    measuring ads, such as device type and identifiers, IP address, coarse
    location derived from the IP address, and ad interactions.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because the Apps are directed to children, every ad request is made with
    child-directed treatment enabled and a maximum ad content rating of "G"
    (general audiences). As a result, ads are requested in a child-appropriate,
    non-personalized way, and the Android advertising identifier is not used to
    personalize ads for these Apps.
  </p>
  <p>
    Google's handling of this data is governed by Google's Privacy Policy and
    its advertising policies:
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
      >policies.google.com/privacy</a
    >
    and
    <a
      href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a
    >.
  </p>

  <h2>In-app purchases</h2>
  <p>
    The Apps offer one optional purchase, <strong>Remove Ads</strong>. Payments
    are processed by <strong>Google Play Billing</strong>. We do not receive or
    store your payment details; Google handles that information under its own
    terms and privacy policy. If you make this purchase, the Apps stop showing
    ads and remember the purchase locally on your device.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>
    The Apps are designed for children and follow applicable children's privacy
    laws, including the U.S. Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA)
    and the GDPR provisions for children. We do not knowingly collect personal
    information from children. Ad requests are child-directed and limited to a
    "G" content rating, as described above.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided personal
    information, please contact us at
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>. Because we operate no
    accounts or servers, we hold no personal data to review or delete.
  </p>

  <h2>Data sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell or share personal information. The only third-party services
    that may process data in the Apps are Google Mobile Ads and Google Play
    Billing, as described above, and only for advertising and payment
    processing.
  </p>

  <h2>Data retention and security</h2>
  <p>
    We retain no personal data on our own systems. Locally stored game data
    remains on your device until you clear an App's data or uninstall it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You can reset or delete your advertising ID in your device settings
      (Settings → Google → Ads).</li>
    <li>You can remove ads permanently with the optional in-app purchase.</li>
    <li>Uninstalling an App removes all locally stored game data.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. Changes are posted on this page
    with a new "Last updated" date.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy? Email
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</MinimalLayout>
